      "message": "Issue: EVSSIM_KERNEL_DIST\u003d${EVSSIM_KERNEL_BRANCH}+ becomes master+ for configs 1–4. The kernel on master is 5.0.0, so\n  the boot files are vmlinuz-5.0.0+, not vmlinuz-master+.\n  Suggestion: Get it from the kernel itself (make -s kernelrelease), or add a version field to configs.json.",
      "revId": "4171ce9a61080abf33a123ff1ecc08f999f1ab7c",
