      "message": "Issue: The branch is hardcoded (master ), and the script is chosen by the compile container name.\n  configs.json\u0027s nvme-cli.branch (EVSSIM_NVME_CLI_BRANCH) is ignored.\n  Suggestion: Use $EVSSIM_NVME_CLI_BRANCH, and choose the build script by branch, not by container.",
